OL,3,ALandlady to 9/11 hijackers reveals
OL,4,Atheir links to alleged Saudi spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FHolly Ratchford still cannot believe
OL,7,Fthat the man who moved into the
OL,8,Fresidential complex she once managed
OL,9,Fwould go on to be accused of
OL,10,Finvolvement in the darkest day in
OL,11,Frecent US history.
OL,13,F"It's almost impossible for me to wrap
OL,14,Fmy head around who he said he was, and
OL,15,Fwho he really is. I still struggle with
OL,16,Fthat," she tells the BBC.
OL,18,FThe man, Omar al-Bayoumi - a Saudi in
OL,19,Fhis early 40s - moved to the complex in
OL,20,FSan Diego, California, with his family
OL,21,Fin September 1999.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
