OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new resident at number 152 Parkwood
OL,7,FApartments quickly became a regular at
OL,8,FRatchford's pool parties. "He was
OL,9,Falways so bubbly and smiling," she
OL,10,Frecalls, "and just very, very
OL,11,Ffriendly."
